Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.77,0:00:06.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}请允许我介绍《永恒之恋》的下一位男嘉宾，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}May I introduce "Everlasting's" next suitor,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.11,0:00:10.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}职业橄榄球四分卫达里乌斯！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}pro quarterback Darius!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.28,0:00:11.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他是黑人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He's black.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.31,0:00:13.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就是打橄榄球的那种黑人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He's like football black.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.48,0:00:14.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那这个丑闻怎么办？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What about this scandal?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.68,0:00:16.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他骂那个记者是婊子。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He called that reporter a bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.35,0:00:17.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}现在是我在管这个节目。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm running the show.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.68,0:00:19.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我能帮你解决公关危机。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I can get you out of your P.R. problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.29,0:00:21.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}上一季你和奎恩把自己的生活搞得一团糟。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You and Quinn blew up your life last season.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.59,0:00:23.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们解决了。你也拿到钱了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We worked it out. You got paid.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.36,0:00:26.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你妈打电话来了。她又和杰瑞米联系上了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Your mother called. She's been talking to Jeremy again.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.26,0:00:29.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你以为我真会因为你就再也不回来吗？是啊。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Do you think I really wouldn't come back because of you? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.06,0:00:31.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这个节目是我的王国。我要把它夺回来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This show is my kingdom. I'm gonna take it back.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.56,0:00:33.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}滚出我的片场。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Get off of my set.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.30,0:00:36.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}女士们，向你们的男嘉宾敞开心扉……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Ladies, open your hearts to your suitor...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.40,0:00:38.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我的男嘉宾到底在哪？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Where the hell is my suitor?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.20,0:00:39.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你想跟他谈，就得先过我这一关。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You want to talk to him, you got to deal with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.81,0:00:42.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}奎恩，如果我一直这样跟着你，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Quinn, if I keep following you around like this,
