Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.08,0:00:46.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我得先带我们躲过这场灾难，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I just got to steer us past this train wreck
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.11,0:00:48.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}然后我会把节目交还给你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and then I will hand the show back to you.
