Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.94,0:02:53.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们向电视台承诺了自杀式收视率，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We promised the network suicide ratings,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.17,0:02:54.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们必须兑现。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and we need to deliver.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.41,0:02:56.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对。帮我做完这个，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Right. Just help me do this,
