Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.54,0:04:03.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}拜托。我就怕这个。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come on. This is what I was afraid of.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.58,0:04:05.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}外面有太多错误信息了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}There is a lot of misinformation out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.85,0:04:07.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}马上把摄像机调过来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We need cameras over here now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.45,0:04:09.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}很多人真的误解了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}A lot of people have a real misunderstanding
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.42,0:04:10.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这面旗到底意味着什么。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}about what this flag is all about.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.88,0:04:12.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，你说得对。是我错了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, you're right. It's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.79,0:04:14.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我一定是太无知了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I must just be plain ignorant.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.96,0:04:16.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这不是种族主义的广告。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's not an advertisement for racism.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.92,0:04:17.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}它没写着“万岁！奴隶制！”\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It doesn't say, "Yay! Slavery!"
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.92,0:04:19.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}拜托。哦，又来了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come on. Oh, here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.86,0:04:21.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}马上派人过来。你知道吗？我爸有家人\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Need people here now. You know what? My daddy had family
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.43,0:04:22.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}在南北战争里战斗并牺牲了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}who fought and died in the Civil War.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.90,0:04:25.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}而且，声明一下，那跟奴隶制毫无关系。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And, for the record, it had nothing to do with slavery.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.70,0:04:27.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那是修正主义的狗屁……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That is a revisionist crock of...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.60,0:04:29.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}去读点书吧。拜托。人都哪儿去了？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Read a book. Come on. Where is everyone?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.77,0:04:32.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你知道吗？你也许为自己的传承感到羞耻，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You know what? You might be ashamed of your heritage,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.84,0:04:35.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但我有种感觉，那位追求者\N{\rEN\blur0.8}but I have a feeling that the suitor
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.04,0:04:37.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}会欣赏我的坦诚。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}is going to appreciate my honesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.54,0:04:39.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你个蠢货。他是黑人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You dumb bitch. He's black.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.32,0:04:43.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}杰在哪儿？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Where's Jay?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.32,0:04:45.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}打扰一下。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.42,0:04:47.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你在干什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.05,0:04:48.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我刚才是私下告诉你的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I just told you that stuff in confidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.86,0:04:50.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你在干什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.62,0:04:52.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你要把那些垃圾放上全国电视？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're gonna put that garbage on national television?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.36,0:04:54.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对，这样你就有东西可以反击\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yes, so you have something to push against
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.56,0:04:56.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}来宣传你的理念。那问题在哪？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}to promote your message. Then what's the problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.83,0:04:59.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你得在镜头开着的时候做。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You need to do it when the cameras are on.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.03,0:05:01.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿。抱歉。我刚在帮蒂芙妮贴乳贴。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey. Sorry. I was just helping Tiffany with her nipple covers.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.40,0:05:02.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}怎么了？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.67,0:05:04.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那么，如果你不想让我抢你的女孩，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So, if you don't want me to steal your girls,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.84,0:05:07.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}能不能把脑袋从蒂芙妮的阴道里拔出来\N{\rEN\blur0.8}can you get your head out of Tiffany's vagina
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.04,0:05:09.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}跟这个傻瓜解释一下节目怎么运作？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and explain to this ding-dong how the show works?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.58,0:05:11.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好了，放松，瑞秋。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, relax, Rachel.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.51,0:05:13.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你不用再试着比昆恩还昆恩了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You can stop trying to out-Quinn Quinn.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.35,0:05:14.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她回来了，你知道的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}She's back, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.32,0:05:15.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗯。这是暂时的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Mnh. This is temporary.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.88,0:05:17.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}也许吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.49,0:05:21.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我真觉得那件比基尼是正确选择。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I really think that that bikini's the way to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.92,0:05:23.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿，别让她封住你的嘴。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey, don't let her silence you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.96,0:05:26.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}言论自由太重要了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Freedom of speech is so important.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.43,0:05:27.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿。你还好吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey. You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.46,0:05:28.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗯，我没事，但是你看，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, I'm fine, but look,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.86,0:05:30.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我开始觉得这是个圈套……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm starting to feel like this is a setup...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.60,0:05:31.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好像我来这儿就是为了跟那个女孩吵架。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Like, I'm just here to fight that girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.80,0:05:34.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不。拜托，露比。你非常重要。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No. Come on, Ruby. You are so important.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.97,0:05:36.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}为什么？因为他点名要我？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Why? Because he asked for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.77,0:05:37.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.87,0:05:38.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}瑞秋说那位追求者\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Rachel said that the suitor
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.87,0:05:40.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}特别点名要了我。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}asked for me specifically.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.44,0:05:42.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她还说我保证能\N{\rEN\blur0.8}She also said that I was guaranteed
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.74,0:05:44.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}进最后两强，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}to make it to the final two,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.41,0:05:46.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}说我有九周时间宣传我们的平台。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}that I'd have nine weeks to promote our platform.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.35,0:05:48.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不知道。你大概应该就……请告诉我吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I don't know. You should probably just... Just tell me, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.95,0:05:50.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我能信她吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Can I trust her?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.46,0:05:59.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不能。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.43,0:06:00.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}啊，糟了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Ah, shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.79,0:06:02.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}听着，对不起，好吗？但她在骗你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Look, I'm sorry, okay? But she's lying to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.00,0:06:05.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他没点名要你。你只是……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He didn't ask for you. You're just...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.43,0:06:07.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你就是那个愤怒的黑婊子，两集就滚蛋，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're the angry black bitch who'll be gone in two episodes,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.70,0:06:08.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}运气好三集。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}three if you're lucky.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.90,0:06:12.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}天啊。我刚做了什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, my God. What did I just do?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.37,0:06:14.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我为这个退了学。我也很生气，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I dropped out of college for this. I'm pissed, too,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.81,0:06:16.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不是因为我想看你“痛骂当权者”\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and not because I wanted to watch you "rail against the man"
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.64,0:06:18.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}接下来九周。你说什么？你以为……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}for the next nine weeks. Excuse me? Is that what you think...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.48,0:06:20.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}今年完全是新局面，露比。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It is a whole new deal this year, Ruby.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.05,0:06:22.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}像你这样的女孩要是有机会，就是现在。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}If a girl like you ever had a shot, this is it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.95,0:06:25.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}听着……你真想做出改变吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Listen... You really want to make a difference?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.39,0:06:27.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}赢下这个破节目。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Win this bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.45,0:06:29.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那才叫革命。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's revolutionary.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.62,0:06:31.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}怎么做？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}How?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.12,0:06:33.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我会把送你到那儿当成人使命，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I will make it my personal mission to get you there,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.83,0:06:37.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但你得听我的，不是瑞秋的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}but you have to listen to me, not Rachel.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.83,0:06:40.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}行吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.13,0:06:42.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}行。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.74,0:06:44.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你们冷吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You guys cold?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.17,0:06:45.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}冻死了！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Freezing!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.54,0:06:47.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好了。各位，挺起胸来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay. Tits up, everybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.44,0:06:49.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}开工！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Let's do this!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.14,0:06:50.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.41,0:06:52.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}呃。看看这个。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Ugh. Look at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.08,0:06:55.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}泳池像火山一样。谁去把温度调低点。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The pool looks like a volcano. Turn the heat down, somebody.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.48,0:06:56.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们的车祸现场准备好了吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Do you have our train wreck ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.92,0:06:57.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那是我的活儿，对吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's my job, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.98,0:06:59.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对。今晚是。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah. For tonight it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.99,0:07:01.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我同情你们。真的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I feel for you guys. I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.62,0:07:02.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我看到你妈给你寄了包裹。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I saw you got a care package from your mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.96,0:07:04.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你打开了吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Did you open it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.12,0:07:06.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗯，打开了。在垃圾桶里。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Mnh, I did. It's in the trash.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.03,0:07:07.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}瑞秋，你得小心点。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Rachel, you need to be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.80,0:07:10.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}昆恩收回节目对你可能是个真正的触发点，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Quinn taking the show back could be a real trigger for you,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.03,0:07:11.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}会让你失控。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}destabilize you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.56,0:07:13.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，不用。你不必担心。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, no. You don't have to worry about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.10,0:07:15.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们纹了一样的闺蜜纹身。我们好得很。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We got matching best-friend tattoos. We're cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.50,0:07:18.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}呃，各位，贝丝·安有动作了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Uh, guys, Beth Ann's on the move.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.10,0:07:22.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好。开始了。我要露比的特写，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay. Here we go. I need tight shots of Ruby,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.01,0:07:25.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}香塔尔，还有，呃，愤怒女警，好吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Chantal, and, uh, Angry Cop, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.65,0:07:27.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所有非白人，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Anybody that is not white,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.08,0:07:29.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我数到就怼到他们脸上。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I want you in their faces on my count.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.78,0:07:32.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}三、二、一，派克大衣！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Three, two, one, parka!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.99,0:07:35.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}天啊。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, God.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.46,0:07:41.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}呃，各位……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Um, guys...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.03,0:07:42.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们是不是该说点什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Shouldn't we say something?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.86,0:07:45.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}说点什么啊！那个黑人活动家怎么不说话？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Say something! Why isn't the Blacktivist saying something?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.97,0:07:48.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}拜托，我们真要让这事就这么过去？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come on. Are we really gonna let this slide?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.20,0:07:50.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是啊，我都替你生气。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah. I mean, I'm offended for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.00,0:07:52.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}耐心点，女士们。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Patience, ladies.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.67,0:07:54.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}来点争议，Quinn？好事。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Little controversy, Quinn? It's good.
