Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.39,0:12:08.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}行。那就打电话给电视台。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Fine. Just call the network, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.96,0:12:10.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}告诉他们。不是电视台的事。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Tell them. It's not the network.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.43,0:12:12.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是加里，他的高尔夫球友。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's Gary, his golfing buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.80,0:12:14.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他们一起去帕克城滑雪。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}They go skiing together at Park City.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.97,0:12:16.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这样吧，让我去跟达瑞斯谈谈。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You know what? Let me just talk to Darius.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.90,0:12:18.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我能劝他讲道理……不行。这是大人的事，好吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I can talk some sense... No. This is grown-up time, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.77,0:12:21.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这你根本管不了。你有什么事？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Way over your head. What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.14,0:12:23.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}贝丝·安把自己锁在浴室里，不让我进去。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Beth Ann's locked in her bathroom and she won't let me in.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.84,0:12:25.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}去。搞定它。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Go. Fix it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.75,0:12:30.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}奎恩。嘿。那个，呃，切特搞的那套男人聚会？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Quinn. Hey. You know, um, Chet's guy thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.88,0:12:32.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别跟我说话！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Stop talking to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.22,0:12:35.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}贝丝·安，我是瑞秋。我能进来吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Beth Ann, it's Rachel. Can I come in?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.22,0:12:36.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不行。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.86,0:12:42.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我真蠢。对不起。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Stupid idiot. I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.10,0:12:43.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好了。出什么问题了？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}All right. What's the problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.33,0:12:44.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗯？你知道那家伙是黑人啊。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hmm? You knew the guy was black.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.76,0:12:47.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不知道那是达瑞斯·贝克。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I didn't know that it was Darius Beck.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.20,0:12:50.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们爱他……简直是崇拜他。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We love him... Like, worship him.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.37,0:12:53.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他真的是我最喜欢的四分卫。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He is literally my favorite quarterback ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.91,0:12:56.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你得找到我的包。我要换衣服。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You got to find my bag. I need to change.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.14,0:12:58.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不行。不。你不能那样做。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Unh-unh. No. You can't do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.01,0:12:59.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你就不能把我从开场镜头里剪掉，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Can't you just cut me out of the opening scene,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.91,0:13:01.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}当成我根本没出现过？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}make it like I was never even there?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.35,0:13:03.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}然后呢？你就让政治正确警察赢了？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And what? Are you just gonna let the PC police win?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.42,0:13:05.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你知道，我从小受的教育不许我无礼。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You know, I was not raised to be rude.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.82,0:13:08.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}再说，我喜欢达瑞斯。我想让他喜欢我。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Besides, I like Darius. I want him to like me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.52,0:13:11.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我是说，这节目比我想象的还要好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I mean, this is better than I ever thought this show could be.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.29,0:13:13.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}种族歧视真让人糊涂，对吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Racism is so confusing, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.99,0:13:15.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那你让不让我换衣服？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So, are you gonna let me change?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.36,0:13:16.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你不能这么做。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You can't do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.93,0:13:19.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}达瑞斯已经见过你穿那件泳衣了，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Darius has already seen you in that bathing suit,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.40,0:13:22.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}而且其他那些女孩都会混成一片。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and plus, all those other girls are just gonna blend into one.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.27,0:13:24.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}至少你会很突出，他会记住你是谁。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}At least you're gonna stand out, and he's gonna know who you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.87,0:13:27.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你手里可是个绝好的机会。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You have a real golden opportunity here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.21,0:13:30.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对，最坏能怎样？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Right, and what's the worst that can happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.31,0:13:32.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他见到你，爱上你，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He meets you and falls in love with you,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.41,0:13:34.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}然后娶你，跟你生一堆孩子？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and, like, marries you and has all your babies?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.28,0:13:36.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对吧？现在我们回去吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Right? Now let's get back out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.35,0:13:38.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我能留着外套吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Can I keep my jacket?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.05,0:13:39.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}来吧。我们走。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come on. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.45,0:13:42.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿。你是警察，对吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey. You're a cop, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.42,0:13:45.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你就不能直接抓她？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Can't you just arrest her?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.46,0:13:47.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我是综合格斗选手。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm an MMA fighter.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.46,0:13:50.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你想让我把她狠狠揍一顿？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Do you want me to just beat the crap out of her?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.40,0:13:52.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}警察。对。我猜那就是“不行”了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Cop. Right. I'm guessing that's a "no."
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.20,0:14:00.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}噢。天啊。真够有品位的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Ooh. Gosh. Really classy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.24,0:14:02.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}在拉斯维加斯你好像不介意。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You didn't seem to mind in Vegas.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.48,0:14:07.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那么，嘿，嘿。你们……你们搞上了？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So, hey, hey. You guys, uh... You guys hooked up?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.11,0:14:09.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，是啊，但没什么大不了的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, yeah, but it was no big deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.45,0:14:12.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但那女孩真野……要不够。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But that girl is a freak... Couldn't get enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.62,0:14:15.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她疯了。你懂我意思吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}She is crazy. You know what I'm saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.42,0:14:17.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是啊。懂。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah. No, I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.16,0:14:19.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她有张医生证明，写的也一样。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}She's got a doctor's note that says the same thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.46,0:14:20.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她有病，哥们。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}She got problems, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.99,0:14:23.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}呃，麦迪逊，那边有女女亲热，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Um, Madison, there's girl-on-girl action
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.53,0:14:25.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}在热水浴缸里，这挺好，很不错，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}in the hot tub, which is good and dandy and everything,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.53,0:14:27.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但这个派对的主题是男人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}but this particular party is about penis.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.53,0:14:29.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我跟你说，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm telling you,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.17,0:14:31.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这会是你最棒的一晚……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}this is going to be the best night of your...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.44,0:14:33.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿，你们。请出去吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey, guys. Just get out of here, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.21,0:14:35.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}谢谢。可切特说我可以活跃一下气氛。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Thank you. But Chet said I could loosen things up a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.24,0:14:36.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我知道。我喜欢这种兄弟会派对的感觉。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I know. I love the frat-party vibe.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.91,0:14:39.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}很好，但现在我们得跟几位女士谈谈。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's great, but right now we got to talk to some ladies.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.04,0:14:41.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她叫贝丝·安。贝丝·安。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Her name is Beth Ann. Beth Ann.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.28,0:14:43.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她来了。来，亲爱的。把外套给我。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Here she is. Here, sweetie. Let me take your coat.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.02,0:14:44.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你好吗，贝丝·安？好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}How you doing, Beth Ann? Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.62,0:14:47.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这就对了。等等！好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}There you go. Wait! Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.02,0:14:49.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}首先，我得说对不起。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}First off, I have to say I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.12,0:14:50.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我欠你一个道歉。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I owe you an apology.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.62,0:14:53.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我大概梦见过见你无数次，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I've dreamt of meeting you probably about a zillion times,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.20,0:14:56.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那些梦里我绝对没穿这个。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and I definitely wasn't wearing this in any of those dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.03,0:14:57.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对。好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Right. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.20,0:14:59.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我爱我的家乡。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I love where I'm from.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.20,0:15:01.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}真的，但我知道这面旗\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I do, but I know that this flag
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.27,0:15:04.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}会让你们这些人很不舒服。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}pushes a lot of buttons for your people.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.10,0:15:06.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们这些人？不。我……我不是那个意思。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}My people? No. That... That's not what I meant.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.38,0:15:09.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我说错话了。只是，达瑞斯，这是个派对，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It came out wrong. It's just, Darius, this is a party,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.94,0:15:11.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们……我们应该好好玩，所以……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and... and we're supposed to be having a good time, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.51,0:15:12.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.95,0:15:15.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所以如果我穿的让你不舒服，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So if what I'm wearing offends you,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.12,0:15:17.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那我真的只有一件事可做，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}then there really is only one thing that I can do,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.32,0:15:20.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}很简单。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and it's real simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.02,0:15:21.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哇！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Whoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.59,0:15:24.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}天啊。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.36,0:15:25.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}荡妇。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Slut.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.56,0:15:28.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我感觉好多了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I feel so much better.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.43,0:15:30.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你呢？你感觉怎么样？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}How 'bout you? How do you feel?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.17,0:15:34.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.47,0:15:35.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我也感觉好多了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I feel better, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.70,0:15:38.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}谢谢。不客气。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Thank you. You're welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.04,0:15:39.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}真是贴心。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's really sweet.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.44,0:15:41.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}来，我帮你扣上。抱歉。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Here, let me button that for you. Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.41,0:15:45.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}虽然不是撕逼大战，但我能把这团乱麻变成黄金。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's not a catfight, but I can turn that hot mess into gold.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.11,0:15:48.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别挡住胸！哦，我们错过了胸！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Don't cover the boobies! Oh, we missed the boobies!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.25,0:15:50.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就像森林里树倒下一样。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's like a tree falling in the forest.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.42,0:15:53.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，我们拍到了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, we have them on camera.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.25,0:15:57.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你们在热水浴缸里，呃，女女亲热了，对吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You did, uh, girl-on-girl action in the hot tub, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.66,0:16:01.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}虚惊一场。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}False alarm.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.06,0:16:03.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所以你就打算这么玩，是吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So, that's how you're gonna play it, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.06,0:16:05.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，得了吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.43,0:16:07.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}得到你想要的……这就是这节目的全部意义。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Getting what you want... That's what the show's all about.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.97,0:16:11.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是你创造的，记得吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You created it, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.40,0:16:13.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这是你的王国。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's your kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.11,0:16:14.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}来拿吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come and get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.15,0:16:22.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们有四小时的硬仗要打。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We have four hours of hard night.
