Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.47,0:20:10.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}可我不是东海岸的，所以……真的？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, I'm not from the East Coast, so... Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.84,0:20:12.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你一股纽约范儿。你上的哪所大学？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You have such a New York vibe. Where'd you go to college?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.68,0:20:14.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}瓦萨学院。我的天。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Vassar. Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.51,0:20:15.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我有一大堆朋友都上瓦萨。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I've got a ton of friends who went to Vassar.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.98,0:20:17.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你到底有什么事，雅尔。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Is there something that you want, Yael.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.75,0:20:20.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们能说实话吗？我是说，能聊聊吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Can we be honest? I mean, can we talk?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.59,0:20:22.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你是说，犹太姐妹之间交交心？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You mean like a hebe to hebe?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.39,0:20:23.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}帮帮姐妹吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Help a sister out.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.79,0:20:25.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这家伙太帅了，可他连看都没看我一眼。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This guy is hot, and he hasn't even looked at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.82,0:20:27.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我只是想听点建议。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I just need some advice.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.29,0:20:28.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你懂这节目。你会怎么做？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You know the show. What would you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.66,0:20:31.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你想听我的建议？过来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You want my advice? Come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.36,0:20:33.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}看到你的制片人麦迪逊了吗？拿着衬衫那个？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You see your producer, Madison? The one holding the shirt?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.51,0:20:34.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你跟着她。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You stick with her.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.60,0:20:36.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那姑娘是个天才。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That girl is a genius.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.91,0:20:43.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我能把他抢过来吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Can I steal him?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.91,0:20:47.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}抱歉。你能把这个穿上吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm sorry. Can you put this on?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.28,0:20:49.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不然我没法直视你的眼睛。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Otherwise, I'm not gonna be able to look you in the eye.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.95,0:20:52.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你其他地方实在太……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The rest of you is just too...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.85,0:20:54.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}让人分心了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}distracting.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.62,0:20:55.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}- 好吧，我穿上。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-All right, I'll put this on.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.86,0:20:57.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这俩人简直就是肯和芭比。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}These two are like Ken and Barbie.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.29,0:20:58.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-我爱死他们了。  -呃。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-I love them.   -Ugh.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.29,0:20:59.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这叫名媛舞会。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's called a cotillion.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.39,0:21:00.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我妈一直在给我筹划\N{\rEN\blur0.8}My mom has been planning mine
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.83,0:21:01.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}从我出生那天起。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}since the day I was born.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.96,0:21:03.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}啊，真贴心。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Ah, that's sweet.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.56,0:21:04.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我打赌你穿燕尾服一定帅呆了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I bet you look amazing in a tux.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.96,0:21:07.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我妈说我打扮起来还挺像样。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, my mother says I do clean up nicely.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.78,0:21:09.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我相信一定是的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm sure you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.54,0:21:11.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}过来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.80,0:21:14.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}呃……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.61,0:21:18.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}怎么了？没事吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What? Is everything okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.51,0:21:20.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，没事。我，我只是……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, yeah. I-I just...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.88,0:21:23.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}第一次约会从不这样。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}never do that on the first date.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.42,0:21:24.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-砰！  -我们可以慢慢来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Bam!   -We can take it slow.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.82,0:21:26.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这是黑人版贤妻。这叫「黑老婆」。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's a black wifey. That's a blifey.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.55,0:21:29.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好了，你可以回头拍拍自己\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, you can pat your liberal white self
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.02,0:21:30.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这个自由派白人的肩膀了，行吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}on the back later, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.52,0:21:33.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗨，达里乌斯。能跟你聊一会儿吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hi, Darius. Could I talk to you for a minute?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.73,0:21:36.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好啊，咱们就聊聊那件T恤吧，达里乌斯。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, let's talk about that t-shirt, Darius.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.36,0:21:37.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好衬衫。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Nice shirt.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.60,0:21:40.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哟，你好啊。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, hello, there.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.53,0:21:42.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}要不要给你拿点喝的，或者……？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Can I get you something to drink or...?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.87,0:21:45.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好啊。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.30,0:21:49.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不用。听着，我，呃，就是想跟你聊聊。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No. Look, I, um, just wanted to talk to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.04,0:21:50.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}让我猜猜……这种场合不是你的菜，对吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Let me guess... this is not your scene, is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.84,0:21:52.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不是。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.68,0:21:54.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}听着，我其实不太清楚自己在这儿干什么。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Look, I'm not really sure what I'm doing here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.58,0:21:56.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我是说，我刚看着你\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I mean, I just watched you create
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.42,0:21:57.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}搞出一场种族彩虹大团结\N{\rEN\blur0.8}some racial rainbow moment
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.95,0:22:00.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}跟一个穿他妈的邦联旗比基尼的婊子，所以……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}with a bitch in a damn Confederate flag bikini, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.32,0:22:01.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}终于有冲突了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Finally, some conflict.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.79,0:22:04.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这有意义。这有观点。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This means something. This has a point of view.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.39,0:22:06.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我觉得这整段都该剪进成片。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I think we should just put this entire thing in the cut.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.43,0:22:08.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}至少剪到她骂她婊子那段，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I mean, at least to the part where she calls her a bitch,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.73,0:22:10.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}因为剩下的有点太「公共电视台」了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}because the rest is a little PBS.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.66,0:22:14.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我知道你觉得自己在把革命搬上电视，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I mean, I know you think you're televising the revolution,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.53,0:22:16.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但我们现在需要的是湿内裤。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}but what we need right now are wet panties.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.07,0:22:20.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}蒂芙尼在哪，我的NFL女孩？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Where is Tiffany, my NFL girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.97,0:22:22.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦！啊！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh! Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.38,0:22:23.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦！不不不不不。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh! Oh, no, no, no, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.84,0:22:24.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不不不。快上。那是我的老婆！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, no, no. Go. That's my wifey!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.91,0:22:26.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}上，瑞秋。上！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Go, Rachel. Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.81,0:22:29.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}抓住她。找到她。敲……不不不不不！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Get her. Find her. Kno... No, no, no, no, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.38,0:22:30.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别跪着了！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Get off your knees!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.65,0:22:33.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}站……我……我需要对讲机！不！不！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Sta... Wi... I need a walkie! No! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.45,0:22:36.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这当然就是你所谓的「好主意」。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Of course this is your version of a good idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.39,0:22:39.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-哦，天啊！  -嗨。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Oh, gosh!   -Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.46,0:22:45.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}请待在这儿别动。别跟任何人说话。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Please stay right here. Do not talk to anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.76,0:22:47.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别跟切特说话。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Do not talk to Chet.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.63,0:22:48.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你在干什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.77,0:22:50.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}抱歉，瑞秋。你吃醋了？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Sorry, Rach. You jealous?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.90,0:22:52.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}少自作多情了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Please don't flatter yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.57,0:22:54.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你真觉得那样能帮到达里乌斯？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You really think that that's gonna help Darius?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.61,0:22:56.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我只是在享受一下而已。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm just having a good time.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.01,0:22:58.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗯。对。Chet在操控你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Mm-hmm. Yes. Chet is manipulating you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.48,0:22:59.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你没有吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And you're not?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.95,0:23:01.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}据我所知，大家都在互相操控。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}As far as I can tell, everyone's manipulating everybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.98,0:23:03.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对，但只有我\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yes, but I am the only one
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.48,0:23:05.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是出于正当的理由。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}that is doing it for the right reasons.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.92,0:23:08.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你不能告诉Darius你和Tiffany搞在一起的事。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You can't tell Darius about hooking up with Tiffany.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.65,0:23:11.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}为什么不行？因为如果你想要那个体育主播的合约\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Why not? 'Cause if you want that sportscaster deal
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.12,0:23:13.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}还有Chet答应你的那些东西，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and all that stuff that Chet promised you,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.06,0:23:15.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你需要她才能办到。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}she's what you need to make it happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.43,0:23:18.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}懂吗？那女孩金发、漂亮、有钱，还是白人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay? The girl is blonde, beautiful, rich, and white.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.73,0:23:22.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那样的女孩要是原谅你，全美国都会原谅你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}If a girl like that forgives you, America forgives you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.17,0:23:23.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一个字都别说。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Not a word.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.18,0:23:32.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}变态。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Pervert.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.04,0:23:33.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}大家，硬核之夜还剩两小时。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We have two hours hard night left, folks.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.58,0:23:35.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好吧，听着，我不知道你期待什么，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, look, I don't know what you expected,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.52,0:23:37.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但我不会对我爸言听计从。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}but I'm not just going to do whatever my dad wants.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.85,0:23:39.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他不能把我当成什么营销手段献出去。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He can't offer me up as some kind of marketing ploy.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.68,0:23:41.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}等等等等。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Whoa, whoa, whoa, whoa.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.72,0:23:44.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我真的，老实说，完全不知道你在说什么。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I really, honestly, have no idea what you're talking about right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.19,0:23:46.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你报了名，我找到了你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You applied, I found you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.76,0:23:48.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}等等，不是吧。你没跟我爸谈过？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Wait, no. You didn't talk to my dad?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.80,0:23:50.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我没跟你爸谈过。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I didn't talk to your dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.50,0:23:51.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我的天。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.53,0:23:55.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}天哪，那感觉就像是\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, that just felt like
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.77,0:23:58.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他会干的事，你懂吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}something that he would do, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.00,0:23:59.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我是说，我以为我也进了沃顿，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I mean, I thought I got into Wharton, too,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.74,0:24:01.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}直到发现他打了几个电话。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}until I found out that he made some phone calls.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.51,0:24:03.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}天啊，你爸帮你进了沃顿？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, my God, your dad helped you get into Wharton?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.11,0:24:05.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}唉，富家女的问题最烦人了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Ugh. Rich-girl problems are the worst.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.94,0:24:09.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}听着，也许是你打的电话，但我还是答应了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Look, you may have called, but I still said yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.58,0:24:11.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我本来很兴奋能来这。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I was excited to come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.58,0:24:13.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我还真以为能遇到某个人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I actually thought that I might meet someone.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.02,0:24:14.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，你确实遇到了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, and you did.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.19,0:24:15.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不，你们把第一晚给毁了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, you guys ruined that night one.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.89,0:24:17.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}拜托。Darius也是个人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come on. Darius is still a person.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.66,0:24:19.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}Darius是个橄榄球员。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Darius is a football player.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.66,0:24:22.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}然后呢？我不想当橄榄球员的老婆。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And? I don't want to be a football wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.46,0:24:25.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我跟我爸这辈子都在干这个。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I have done that my entire life with my dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.53,0:24:27.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我微笑，闭嘴，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I smile, I keep my mouth shut,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.80,0:24:31.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}当个漂亮的花瓶，我受够了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}provide excellent arm candy, and I am done.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.60,0:24:33.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但如果你不想别人评判你\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But if you don't want people to judge you
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.14,0:24:34.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}或者对你妄加揣测，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}or make assumptions about you,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.47,0:24:35.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那你就不能这样对Darius。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}then you can't do that to Darius.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.81,0:24:37.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你是说他不是橄榄球员？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're saying he's not a football player?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.48,0:24:39.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我只是说，你根本不知道他是什么样的人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm just saying that you have no idea what he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.14,0:24:41.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他可以是任何样子。他可能是你的灵魂伴侣。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He could be anything. The guy could be your soul mate.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.15,0:24:43.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}更疯狂的事都发生过。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Crazier things have happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.22,0:24:46.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我只是觉得你应该敞开心去体验。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I just think you should make yourself open to the experience.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.69,0:24:49.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我只是说说。他是个特别好的人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm just saying. He's a really good guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.92,0:24:52.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你想让我怎么做？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What do you want me to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.09,0:24:55.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我想让你求上帝保佑Romeo闭嘴\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I want you to pray to God that Romeo keeps his mouth shut
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.13,0:24:57.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那些东西一个都别播出去。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and none of that stuff makes it to air.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.16,0:24:58.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你得帮我。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You have to help me.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.13,0:25:01.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}Jay，别演黑人活动家了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Jay, enough of the black activist.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.57,0:25:03.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}把我老婆弄进去。全靠你了。快去快去！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Get my wifey in there. This is all you. Go, go, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.20,0:25:04.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}听着，我们不如讨论……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Listen, why don't we discuss...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.70,0:25:05.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗨。什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hi. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.90,0:25:06.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-这荡妇是谁？  -嗨。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Who's the slut?   -Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.81,0:25:08.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}真抱歉打断你们。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm so sorry to interrupt.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.67,0:25:10.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}能借你几分钟吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Can I steal you for a minute?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.58,0:25:11.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}当然。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Definitely.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.94,0:25:13.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我想我们这边谈完了，对吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I think we were done here, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.92,0:25:17.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.28,0:25:21.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}而且，我本来就一直想找你谈。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And besides, I've been meaning to talk to you anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.82,0:25:23.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你对德州一无所知。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You know nothing about Texas.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.99,0:25:25.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我就是德州人。我在那儿长大的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm from Texas. I grew up there.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.19,0:25:26.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不，我……算了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, I've... Doesn't matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.59,0:25:28.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我整个职业生涯都在德州。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I spent my entire career in Texas.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.09,0:25:29.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我懂德州。不不不不。我爱德州……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I know Texas. No, no, no, no, no. I love Texas...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.00,0:25:31.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好吧。但你得承认，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay. But you have to admit,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.63,0:25:33.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}烧烤确实二流。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}barbecue was decidedly second-rate.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.83,0:25:35.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你没去过County Line吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You haven't been to County Line, have you?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.17,0:25:36.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不，有，我去过。我爸带我去的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, yes, I have. My dad took me there.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.84,0:25:38.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yo...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.31,0:25:43.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}听着，我们不如别扯这些了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Look, why don't we knock all this off
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.01,0:25:45.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}直接聊聊那个明摆着的问题？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and just talk about the elephant in the room?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.15,0:25:50.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我以为你把那事摆平了，Rachel。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I thought you shut that down, Rachel.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.22,0:25:53.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你要是没保护好我老婆，我们就有大麻烦了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}If you didn't protect my wifey, we're gonna have a real problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.95,0:25:56.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我知道你爸拥有那支球队，而那支球队正好是\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I know your dad owns the team that happens to be
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.82,0:25:58.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}联盟里我们最大的对手。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}our biggest competition in the league.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.72,0:26:01.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他仗着财大气粗压了我们好多年。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He's been cock-blocking us for years with his deep pockets.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.16,0:26:06.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我爸。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}My dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.03,0:26:07.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-对。  -对。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Yeah.   -Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.70,0:26:10.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好啊。你想撕破脸？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay. You want to go there?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.20,0:26:12.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你什么时候才能走出那个框框\N{\rEN\blur0.8}When are you gonna get out of the box
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.10,0:26:13.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好好用用你的腿？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and start using your damn legs?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.98,0:26:15.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你的步法太烂了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Your footwork is terrible.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.64,0:26:17.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}很高兴认识你。你被淘汰了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It was a pleasure meeting you. You're eliminated.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.74,0:26:20.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-哦不！  -你怎么能这样对我？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Oh, no!   -How could you do me like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.05,0:26:22.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这就是节目，Rachel。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This is the show, Rachel.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.25,0:26:24.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}幸好有我在。你知道吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Thank God I'm here. You know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.92,0:26:26.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我为你跑了一整晚，好吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I've been running around for you all night, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.99,0:26:27.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我给你找来了这些女孩。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I got you these girls.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.99,0:26:30.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你却把追求者弄丢了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And you lost the suitor.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.22,0:26:32.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你把小环节都做了，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You did all the small parts,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.16,0:26:34.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}却搞砸了最重要的部分。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}but you screwed up the biggest part.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.06,0:26:36.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你以为我这么多年\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Do you think that I ran around yelling at you
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.76,0:26:38.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}冲你大吼大叫是闹着玩吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}all of those years for fun?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.90,0:26:41.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我为你安排好了，但你得拿出成果。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I set this up for you, but you need to deliver.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.77,0:26:43.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好吧，那你得让我来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, well, you need to let me.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.67,0:26:45.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}让你？对，让我来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Let you? Yes. Let me.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.00,0:26:47.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}干这行得有一副铁脊梁，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It takes an iron spine
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.27,0:26:49.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}还得沉得住气。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and a steady hand to do this job.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.88,0:26:51.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不知道。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.74,0:26:54.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}也许你妈说得对。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Maybe your mother was right.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.12,0:26:57.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.38,0:26:59.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我是说，拜托。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I mean, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.02,0:27:02.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们都知道你……出过状况。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We all know you've had... episodes.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.82,0:27:05.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你很棒……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're great...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.66,0:27:07.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}直到你崩掉为止。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}until you're not.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.79,0:27:11.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但你脑子里确实有点不正常，懂吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But you got a couple of whirligigs in there, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.33,0:27:13.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}以前倒没关系，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Which was fine before,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.77,0:27:15.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但如果你想当老板，就不太行了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}but not so much if you want to be the boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.00,0:27:20.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她给你打电话了？你在跟我妈说话？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Did she call you? Are you talking to my mother?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.04,0:27:22.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}算了吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Let's just forget it.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.34,0:27:24.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你不如回去现场\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Why don't you just get back out there
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.01,0:27:26.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}让自己有点用？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and make yourself useful?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.85,0:27:36.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}瑞秋？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Rachel?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.26,0:27:38.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，你现在还抽上烟了？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, so you're smoking now?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.89,0:27:41.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}真酷。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.13,0:27:42.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所以你就打算变成奎恩了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So you're just gonna become Quinn.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.96,0:27:44.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}明白了。这就说得通多了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Got it. That makes so much more sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.93,0:27:46.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那我什么时候能等到你剪头发？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}When can I expect the haircut?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.43,0:27:49.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不过你也没那颧骨撑起那发型。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Not that you got the cheekbones to pull it off.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.01,0:27:59.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}天哪，瑞秋，你不该在这儿。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Jesus Christ, Rachel, you shouldn't be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.74,0:28:02.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你想让我去哪儿？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Where'd you want me to go?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.21,0:28:04.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你想让奎恩一回来我就辞职吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Did you want me to just quit when Quinn came back?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.72,0:28:06.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不知道。也许吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I don't know. Maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.69,0:28:08.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我是说，那至少能表明\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I mean, that would've been one way to say
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.42,0:28:10.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}有些狗屎你还不肯吃。那你呢？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}there's at least some shit you won't eat. And what about you?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.79,0:28:12.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我以为你会欣赏我\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I thought ' you would appreciate me
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.22,0:28:14.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}试着至少稍微反叛一点。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}trying to be at least a tiny bit subversive.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.33,0:28:16.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}反叛？那算哪门子……可你倒好，你完全\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Subversive? What does that even... But instead, you just completely
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.86,0:28:19.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}从一开始就在鲁比的事上怂了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}pussied out on Ruby from the beginning.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.16,0:28:21.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}老兄，你把自己对这工作的自我厌恶\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Dude, you used your own self-loathing about working here
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.77,0:28:23.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}当成放她走的某种理由。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}as some sort of justification for letting her go.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.94,0:28:26.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你就像在故意……我们能不能别吵了？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's like you are deliberately... Can we stop fighting, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.07,0:28:28.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}想搞垮我。到底为什么？你找错人了，瑞秋。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Trying to sabotage me. What is it? I am the wrong target, Rach.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.91,0:28:30.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你是不是嫉妒升职的是我不是你？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Are you jealous that I got promoted instead of you?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.98,0:28:32.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就为这个？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Is that what this is about?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.14,0:28:33.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不是因为我嫉妒你，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's not that I'm jealous of you,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.72,0:28:36.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}因为我不信你真的升职了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}because I don't believe you actually got promoted.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.38,0:28:38.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我是你上司。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm your boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.32,0:28:39.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}只要奎恩还在，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}As long as Quinn's around,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.78,0:28:43.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她就是我老板，也是你老板。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}she's my boss, and she's your boss, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.02,0:28:45.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}醒醒吧，瑞秋，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Wake up, Rachel,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.26,0:28:47.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}因为奎恩永远不会离开这里……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}because Quinn is never leaving this place...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.46,0:28:52.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}除非你从她冰冷的死手里把《永恒》抠出来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Not until you pry "Everlasting" out of her cold, dead hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.87,0:28:58.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿，瑞秋。你没事吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey, Rach. You all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.97,0:29:02.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好。呃，我们得把这个拿到片场，所以……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Cool. Uh, well, we need to take this to set, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.51,0:29:04.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}大家快点。赶紧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Guys, hurry up. Hustle.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.88,0:29:06.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们得把这拿到片场。走吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We got to take this to set. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.18,0:29:08.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.45,0:29:17.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}谢谢。你演得很好。太棒了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Thank you. You were great. That was awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.32,0:29:21.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哼。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Psht.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.83,0:29:26.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}看着你用化学品和垃圾糟蹋自己的身体，真可悲。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's sad to watch you sully your temple with chemicals and crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.13,0:29:28.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}顺便说一句，我看到了那个假小子\N{\rEN\blur0.8}By the way, I saw the butch little thing
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.23,0:29:29.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你跟蒂芙妮搞的那点事。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}you had going with Tiffany.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.54,0:29:31.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不知道你答应了她什么，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I don't know what you promised her,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.47,0:29:34.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但我让她跟那个表亲舌吻了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}but I got her playing tonsil hockey with the cousin.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.17,0:29:35.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我打算播出去。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I intend to air it.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.01,0:29:39.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}啊。那当然，老婆人选就拜拜了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Ahh. Then, of course, it's bye-bye, wifey.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.48,0:29:44.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你知道，请明白，不管你拼凑出什么\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You know, please understand that nothing you cobble together
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.48,0:29:46.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}都永远播不出去，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}will ever make it to air,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.45,0:29:49.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}因为美国观众想要的，和电视台知道他们想要的\N{\rEN\blur0.8}because what America wants and what the network knows they want
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.36,0:29:51.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是一个童话，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}is a fairy tale,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.12,0:29:53.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不在乎你现在迷上哪个大师的\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and I don't care what guru, transformational bullshit
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.96,0:29:56.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}什么心灵蜕变鬼话，但你在情感上\N{\rEN\blur0.8}you're into now, but you are emotionally
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.80,0:30:00.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}和生理上都给不了别人这种东西。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and physically incapable of delivering that to anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.23,0:30:01.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}拜托。不行。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come on. No.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.50,0:30:04.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你得让美国观众有感觉，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You need to make America feel something,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.14,0:30:05.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}唯一能做到这一点的\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and the only thing that can do that
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.80,0:30:07.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就是一个真真正正的贤妻\N{\rEN\blur0.8}is an honest-to-God wifey
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.31,0:30:09.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}端庄又支持他……端庄？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}who is demure and supportive... Demure?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.24,0:30:12.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}而且最重要的是，配得上。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And, most importantly, worthy.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.28,0:30:14.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但不幸的是，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But unfortunately,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.38,0:30:16.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那种女人就算扇你一巴掌，你也认不出来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}you wouldn't know one of those if she slapped you in the face.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.82,0:30:18.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}也许你该试试当个贤妻\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Maybe you should try being a wifey
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.45,0:30:20.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}再来教我贤妻是什么。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}before you lecture me about what one is.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.29,0:30:22.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你好像也没法\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You don't seem to be able
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.05,0:30:23.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}让自己跨过那条线。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}to drag yourself across that line, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.56,0:30:25.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对吧，奎妮？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Do you, Quinnie?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.96,0:30:27.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，不！雅艾尔！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, no! Yael!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.43,0:30:29.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}巴里！巴里，快去处理！杰瑞米，也去！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Barry! Barry, get on that! Jeremy, got on it!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.13,0:30:31.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}呃，瑞秋？！来人，帮帮她！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Uh, Rachel?! Someone, help her!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.13,0:30:33.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}巴里，你在拍吗？！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Barry, are you on it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.40,0:30:35.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}拍到了吗？！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You getting it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.20,0:30:36.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}拍下来！拉近！拉近！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Film that! Zoom in! Zoom in!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.90,0:30:38.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}巴里，快拍！杰瑞米，盯紧！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Barry, get on that! Jeremy, stay on it!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.07,0:30:40.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没事的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.27,0:30:43.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对！这才叫童话。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yes! That is a fairy tale.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.21,0:30:44.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}瑞秋到底在哪？！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Where the hell is Rachel?!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.20,0:31:07.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}行吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.50,0:31:13.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿。哦。你还好吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey. Ooh. You all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.04,0:31:15.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我没事，老兄。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm fine, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.01,0:31:16.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不，我来管他的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No. I'll take his.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.38,0:31:18.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这里是瓦格斯坦医生的疗伤角。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This is Dr. Wagerstein's healing nook.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.94,0:31:22.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你们连照片什么的都没有吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You guys don't have pictures or anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.35,0:31:24.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我怎么可能记住这些女孩的名字？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}How am I supposed to remember these girls' names?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.42,0:31:28.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-这是什么？  -给你。小抄。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-What's this?   -Here. Cheat sheet.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.19,0:31:29.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}小抄。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}A cheat sheet.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.49,0:31:31.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你想选谁就选谁。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You just get to pick the one you want to pick.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.29,0:31:32.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}只要选那个大胸妹就行。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Long as you pick the titty girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.52,0:31:34.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，你是说那个种族歧视的？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, you mean the racist?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.16,0:31:36.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不，我是说那个金发妹。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No. I mean, the blondie.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.06,0:31:38.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就是那个主动站出来\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You know, the one who put herself out there
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.20,0:31:39.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}想弥补过错的那个。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}to make things right.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.63,0:31:41.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，美国观众就吃这一套……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, America digs that kind of thing...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.40,0:31:43.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你知道的，第二次机会、救赎什么的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You know, second chances and redemption.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.14,0:31:45.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-白人女孩。  -白人女孩。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-White girls.   -White girls.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.27,0:31:48.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}蒂芙尼。她挺不错的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Tiffany. She's pretty awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.31,0:31:49.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不知道。也许没那么好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I don't know. Maybe not so awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.58,0:31:52.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗯？罗密欧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Huh, Romeo?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.34,0:31:53.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}什么？怎么了？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What? What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.55,0:31:57.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你确定你没事吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Are you sure that you're okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.18,0:31:59.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我是说，如果你需要，我可以给你叫医生或者……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I mean, if you need to, I can call you a doctor or...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.55,0:32:01.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我没事。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.35,0:32:03.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}真的？麦迪逊，你看过我的档案吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Really? Madison, you read my file, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.46,0:32:06.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我可是在莎拉·劳伦斯游了整整四年泳。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You know I swam for Sarah Lawrence all four years?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.06,0:32:07.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我是200米接力的最后一棒。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I anchored the 200 meter relay.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.59,0:32:10.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所以……怎样？你就……你就……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So... what? You... You just...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.53,0:32:13.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我滑了一跤。哎呀。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I slipped. Oops.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.33,0:32:15.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}让达里乌斯注意到我了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Got Darius to notice me.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.40,0:32:17.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你的老板们好像很喜欢。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Your bosses seemed to love it.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.24,0:32:19.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}看来是双赢。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Guess it was a win for both of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.00,0:32:21.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}谢谢，但是……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Thank you, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.24,0:32:24.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}听着，我知道想在老板面前表现是什么滋味\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Listen, I know what it's like to want to impress a boss
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.01,0:32:25.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}尤其是在竞争这么激烈的环境里。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}in a highly competitive environment.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.71,0:32:27.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我可以帮你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I can help you do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.61,0:32:30.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}只要……帮帮我。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Just... help me.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.42,0:32:33.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}给我点独处时间……也许来次单独约会？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Get me some alone time... Maybe a one-on-one date?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.29,0:32:38.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好了各位，来把这些姑娘淘汰掉。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, people, let's cut these bitches.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.12,0:32:40.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你介意我全权指挥吗，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Are you okay with me calling all the shots,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.99,0:32:42.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}还是你也想来指挥？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}or would you like to do that, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.33,0:32:44.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我想我们都清楚，你……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I think we both know that you're...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.03,0:32:46.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你比我更擅长这个。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're better at that than I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.20,0:32:48.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}三、二、一，开机。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Three, two, one. Rolling.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.40,0:32:51.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}姑娘们，今晚你们26个人满怀真心来到这里……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Ladies, 26 of you came here tonight with an open heart...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.54,0:32:54.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}剪辑注意，把这些都切开……满怀对一生难忘之旅的期待。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey, editors, make sure you just cut this all up....and high hopes for a journey of a lifetime.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.37,0:32:56.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}剪得比实际精彩多了。这段旅程今晚在这里结束。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Make it far more interesting than it really is. That journey ends here tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.31,0:32:58.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你们会和他共度短暂的时刻\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You'll share a brief moment with him
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.34,0:33:00.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他会把镯子递给你们。你不如去做点有用的事？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}while he hands you a bracelet. Why don't you go and be useful?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.48,0:33:03.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没听到自己名字的，就该说再见了。达里乌斯？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}If you don't hear your name called, it's time to say goodbye. Darius?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.02,0:33:05.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}今晚对我来说真的难以置信。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This has truly been an incredible night for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.12,0:33:07.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我觉得自己是世上最幸运的男人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I feel like the luckiest man in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.12,0:33:09.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}话虽如此……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}With that said...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.42,0:33:11.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}B机，你睡着了吗？雅艾尔。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Camera B, are you asleep? Yael.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.29,0:33:16.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}海莉。詹姆森。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hayley. Jameson.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.40,0:33:19.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}多米尼克。布兰迪。现在来真的了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Dominique. Brandi. Now it's getting real.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.20,0:33:21.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-伦敦。  -她没戴头巾。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-London.   -She's not wearing her scarf.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.03,0:33:22.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}香黛尔。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Chantal.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.14,0:33:25.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}贝丝·安。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Beth Ann.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.54,0:33:27.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，太好了！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.34,0:33:30.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}疯癫的白人穷鬼还能再活一天！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Crazy white trash will live to see another day!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.14,0:33:32.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-赞美主！  -太好了！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Praise the Lord!   -Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.48,0:33:35.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}快走。走吧。走快点。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come on. Let's go. Walk a little faster.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.32,0:33:39.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}给我个当老婆的，因为这看起来就像\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Give me a wifey, because this looks like
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.68,0:33:41.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}该死的贝纳通广告，行吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}a freakin' Benetton ad, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.59,0:33:44.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我可不会把全部希望押在性感瑞秋身上。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And I am not pinning all my hopes on Hot Rachel.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.76,0:33:48.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}呃……他没选蒂芙尼，还真奇怪。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's, uh... It's weird that he's not picking Tiffany.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.73,0:33:52.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}露比。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Ruby.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.16,0:33:54.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好吧。露比。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}All right. Ruby.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.50,0:33:59.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}看来我还是可能看到女人打架。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So, just might get my catfight after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.10,0:34:01.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}“我无法呼吸。”我要那件T恤。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}"I can't breathe." I need that shirt.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.54,0:34:03.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}贝丝·安？真的假的？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Beth Ann? Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.71,0:34:05.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他们逼我留下她。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}They made me keep her.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.38,0:34:07.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他们也是逼你留下我的？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}They make you keep me, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.15,0:34:09.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不是。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.38,0:34:11.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}可我要是剪掉一个穿那件T恤的姑娘，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But how am I gonna go in the locker room
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.25,0:34:14.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}还怎么进更衣室面对我的队友？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and face my teammates if I cut a girl wearing that?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.42,0:34:17.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这种我还有很多。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, I got a lot more where these came from.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.32,0:34:19.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你也许真能学到点东西。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You might actually learn a thing or two.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.36,0:34:21.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我很期待。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I look forward to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.50,0:34:26.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好了，黑人姑娘我够了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}All right, I got enough black girls.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.06,0:34:27.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}给我来点白人姑娘。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Give me some white girls.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.13,0:34:28.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}霍莉。菲德拉。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Holly. Phaedra.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.60,0:34:30.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}考特尼。佐伊。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Courtney. Zoe.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.57,0:34:32.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}达里乌斯，我们只剩最后一只手镯了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Darius, we are down to our final bracelet.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.34,0:34:35.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}最后一只。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Last bracelet.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.24,0:34:38.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}今晚我最后一只手镯，送给……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}My final bracelet for this evening goes to...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.14,0:34:40.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}蒂芙尼。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Tiffany.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.41,0:34:44.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哈哈。蒂芙尼。太好了！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Ha ha. Tiffany. Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.48,0:34:46.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}至少我们有个当老婆的了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}At least we got a wifey.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.35,0:34:51.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我就知道。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I knew it.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.36,0:34:54.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}跟你说，我干什么都不会是最后一个被选的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You know, I don't get picked last for anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.23,0:34:55.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你还在我就很高兴了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm just glad you're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.13,0:34:59.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}姑娘们……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Ladies...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.70,0:35:01.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你们的旅程到此结束。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}your journey ends here.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.40,0:35:03.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-晚安。  -卡！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Good night.   -And that's a cut!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.20,0:35:05.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}给那些姑娘披上外套。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Put those girls in coats.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.50,0:35:07.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}节目结束了，各位。姑娘们，呃，走之前，我那儿有个派对。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Show's over, everybody. Ladies, uh, before you leave, I'm having a party in my place.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.28,0:35:08.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你能把那个派对取消吗，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Can you shut down that party,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.77,0:35:11.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}还有，能把格雷厄姆锁在他房里吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and can you lock Graham in his room, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.45,0:35:14.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}各位，这一季说不定真不错。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This could be a good season after all, everybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.37,0:35:39.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你怎么来了？出什么事了？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What are you doing here? Something wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.30,0:35:41.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你们怎么不拍了？有问题吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Why aren't you guys shooting? Is there a problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.64,0:35:43.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不一定非要有。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}There doesn't have to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.48,0:35:45.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}很抱歉拿这事来烦你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm really sorry to bother you with this.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.51,0:35:47.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不知道还能找谁。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I didn't know where else to turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.18,0:35:49.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我知道我这是在越级\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Now, I mean, I know that I'm breaking rank
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.31,0:35:51.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}也知道这事挺尴尬的\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and that this is awkward at best,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.68,0:35:53.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但我两个老板现在水火不容。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}but my two bosses are at each other's throats.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.82,0:35:55.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}谁？Chet？对。还有Quinn。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Who? Chet? Yeah. And Quinn.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.59,0:35:57.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你也知道他俩的过节吧，Gary？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I mean, you know their history, right, Gary?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.69,0:35:59.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}知道。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.36,0:36:01.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好。他俩现在已经闹得不可开交了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay. So, it's gotten crazy ugly between the two of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.16,0:36:02.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我的事业全靠他们。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I mean, look, I owe them my career.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.93,0:36:04.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我爱他们，真的，但我更爱这档节目，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I love them. I do, but I love this show even more,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.86,0:36:06.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我真的很想让它继续下去，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and I really want it to continue,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.40,0:36:08.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}可事到如今，我不确定它还能不能撑住。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and at this point, I'm just not sure it will.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.60,0:36:12.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}抱歉。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.57,0:36:17.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他们在做两个不同的版本，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}They're making two different versions of the show,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.84,0:36:20.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}然后让你选你更喜欢哪一个。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and they're leaving it up to you to pick which one you prefer.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.34,0:36:22.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.21,0:36:25.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我知道你刚给了Quinn一份大合约\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And, look, I know that you just gave Quinn this huge overall deal
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.85,0:36:28.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}Chet也一向是顾全大局的人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and Chet's always been a big-picture kind of guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.49,0:36:30.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但Gary，真正一直在\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But, Gary, I'm really the one that has been
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.29,0:36:32.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一线打拼、一年年交出一个又一个故事的人\N{\rEN\blur0.8}boots-on-the-ground, delivering story after story
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.66,0:36:35.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是我。而且今年，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}for you every year, and, I mean, this year,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.66,0:36:38.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}因为有我，我们真的要创造历史了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}because of me, we're actually gonna be making history.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.23,0:36:39.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我只是觉得，不能就这么让\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You know, I just don't think that we can leave it
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.90,0:36:41.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}Chet和Quinn把我们的事搞砸。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}up to Chet and Quinn to mess this up for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.97,0:36:43.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我该给他们打个电话。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I should give them a call.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.40,0:36:45.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你该给他们打个电话。对。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You should give them a call. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.34,0:36:47.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我已经让Quinn打电话联系你了，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I already told Quinn to call you and reach out to you,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.64,0:36:50.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但她说没意义，因为你和Chet，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}but she said there was no point, because, you know, you and Chet,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.28,0:36:52.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你们俩嘛，关系铁，是好兄弟。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}you guys are, you know, tight. You're bros.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.81,0:36:56.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}Quinn不是你导师吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Uh, isn't Quinn your mentor?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.95,0:36:59.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是啊。她曾经是。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah. She was. She was.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.65,0:37:01.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}Gary，今年是我在管这档节目，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I mean, Gary, I'm running the show this year,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.45,0:37:03.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但他们在吵，我实在……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}but with them fighting, I just...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.72,0:37:06.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他们在片场，我没法做。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I can't produce it with them on set.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.22,0:37:09.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你只要把他们送回家，让他们冷静冷静。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You just need to send them home, give them some time to cool off.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.49,0:37:11.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他们把我训练得这么好。交给我你绝对放心。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}They have trained me so well. You are in such good hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.80,0:37:15.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}相信我，Gary，我挺你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Trust me. I have got your back, Gary.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.27,0:37:18.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我能做到。我准备好了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I can do this. I'm ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.57,0:37:22.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不行不行，废话太多了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, no, man. It's too much talking.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.01,0:37:23.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}跟Merchant Ivory的文艺片似的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's like a Merchant Ivory movie.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.98,0:37:25.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}直接切到胸部镜头吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Cut to the titty shot, already.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.41,0:37:26.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们没有胸部镜头。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We don't have the titty shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.81,0:37:28.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那就上网搜啊！我也没办法。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, Google it! I don't know what to tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.75,0:37:30.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就双重剪辑。放大。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Just double cut it. Blow it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.98,0:37:33.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}放慢。好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Slow it down. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.28,0:37:34.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我要你弄得像\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I need you to make it look like
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.52,0:37:36.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这里真有过一个瞬间，行吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}there was a real moment here, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.52,0:37:42.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哈哈！谢谢。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Ha ha! Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.53,0:37:44.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这才是看女人的眼神。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That is how you look at a woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.60,0:37:47.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这儿简直像本说明书。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's like a damn instruction manual over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.33,0:37:49.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}放起来吧。看看。末日来了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And let her rip. Let's see it. The apocalypse.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.90,0:38:22.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你们到底在干什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What in the hell are you guys doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.57,0:38:24.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}Gary。不，我……我很抱歉，Chet。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Gary.   -No. I-I-I-I'm sorry, Chet.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.74,0:38:26.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这车已经脱轨了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This train is off the rails.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.50,0:38:28.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不，是他脱轨了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No. He's off the rails.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.77,0:38:31.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是吗，Quinn？那你怎么不接电话？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Really, Quinn? Well, then, why didn't you pick up the phone?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.34,0:38:33.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}因为那才是执行制片人该做的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Because that's what an executive producer would do.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.68,0:38:35.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}行吗？你让穿比基尼的女人站在北极！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}All right? You've got women in bikinis on the North Pole up there!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.51,0:38:37.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那是他的主意！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That was his idea!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.48,0:38:39.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}听我说。听我说！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Listen to me. Listen to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.48,0:38:41.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我听说，你让自己的私人问题\N{\rEN\blur0.8}From what I hear, you've let your personal problems
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.76,0:38:42.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}影响了工作。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}get in the way of the job.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.99,0:38:44.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们需要这档节目，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Now, we need this show,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.92,0:38:47.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}在你重新专注工作之前，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and until you can get your eye back on the ball,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.59,0:38:49.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我要换个人来负责。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm putting someone else in charge.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.96,0:38:52.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你说什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Uh, excuse me?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.73,0:38:55.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对，一个懂得怎么讲故事的人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah. Someone who knows how to tell a story.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.67,0:38:58.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一个能给美国观众\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Someone who can give the American public
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.70,0:39:03.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他们每季都期待看到的、我们大家都爱的这档节目。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}what they expect every season from this show we all love.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.94,0:39:06.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是吗。那是谁？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, really. And who might that be?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.61,0:39:10.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}Coleman Wasserman，请进来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Coleman Wasserman, come in here, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.92,0:39:13.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}过来，兄弟。你好，Gary。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Come here, buddy.   -Hey, Gary.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.89,0:39:18.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}如果你不知道这家伙是谁，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Now, if you don't know who this guy is,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.06,0:39:21.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你该知道，我们一直在找机会\N{\rEN\blur0.8}you should, because we have been looking for a chance
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.09,0:39:23.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}想跟这家伙合作，很久了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}to do something with this guy for ages.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.06,0:39:25.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他在《Blink》做的每样东西都爆了……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Everything he does on "Blink" blows up...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.86,0:39:28.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}光是第一周就一千万观众。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}10 million viewers in the first week alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.80,0:39:30.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}Gary，别这样。不不不。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Gary, come on.   -No, no, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.57,0:39:33.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}因为这家伙，Blink都要变成电视网了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Blink is gonna become a network because of this guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.77,0:39:36.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}拜托，Gary，这完全没必要。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, come on, Gary. This is totally unnecessary.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.57,0:39:37.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你知道这些年\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Do you have any idea how much money
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.88,0:39:39.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我为你赚了多少钱吗？！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I've made for you over the years, huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.68,0:39:42.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不，Chet，你打造出的是一台运转良好的机器，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, no. What you've made, Chet, is a well-oiled machine
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.71,0:39:45.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}只是需要个强人来掌舵。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}that needs someone strong at the helm.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.38,0:39:48.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}要么你配合，兄弟，要么你回家，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Look, either you get on board, buddy, or you go home,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.05,0:39:51.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}因为现在是他说了算。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}because he is the one in charge now.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.42,0:39:53.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}行吗？就交给你们了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}All right? I leave it with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:56.03,0:39:57.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你们好。你好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Hi, guys.   -Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.70,0:39:59.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我很期待开始干活。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Look, I'm excited to get to work here.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.00,0:40:00.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}喂，喂，Chet。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey. Hey. Uh, Chet.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.46,0:40:01.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}等一下。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}One second.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.77,0:40:03.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我看得出你们俩各自的想法。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Look, I see what you're both going for.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.80,0:40:05.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}两个版本都有可取之处。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}There's merit in both versions.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.57,0:40:07.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}目前嘛，我想倾向Chet的做法。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}For now, I think I want to lean into what Chet's doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.64,0:40:10.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}谢了，兄弟。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Thanks, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.04,0:40:11.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}《EverBlasting》。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}"EverBlasting."
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.91,0:40:13.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好，行。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.41,0:40:15.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}管它是什么，迫不及待。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Whatever that is. Can't wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.58,0:40:17.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}回头聊。好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-We'll talk.   -Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.18,0:40:18.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.98,0:40:20.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}很高兴认识你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So nice to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.89,0:40:23.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-麦迪逊。  -麦迪逊。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Madison.   -Madison.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.16,0:40:26.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-你好。  -你好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Hey.   -Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.93,0:40:28.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我还真知道你是谁。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I actually know who you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.83,0:40:32.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我看过你拍的那部关于柬埔寨流离失所性工作者的剧集。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I saw that displaced Cambodian sex worker series you did.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.50,0:40:33.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}非常好。你刚谷歌的吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It was very good. You just Googled that.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.80,0:40:35.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不，我没有。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No. I didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.47,0:40:37.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}信不信由你，我感兴趣的东西远不止\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Belive it or not, I am interested in a lot more
Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.54,0:40:38.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}《永恒》这一部剧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}than just "Everlasting."
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.57,0:40:40.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，我信。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, I belive it.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:40.60,0:40:42.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我也知道你是谁。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I know who you are, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.81,0:40:46.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}加里说你和奎恩是黄金搭档。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Gary said you and Quinn make a great team.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.01,0:40:47.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你知道，我们俩一起共事\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, you know, we've been working together
Dialogue: 0,0:40:47.58,0:40:50.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}很久了，所以……是啊。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}for a long time, so... yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.88,0:40:52.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我猜她还不知道\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm guessing she doesn't know
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.65,0:40:54.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是你向电视台投诉\N{\rEN\blur0.8}that you're the one who complained to the network
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.85,0:40:56.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}把我弄来的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and brought me here.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.12,0:40:57.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}呼！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Phew!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:57.86,0:41:00.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我得说，这招够魄力。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I got to say that's a baller move.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.52,0:41:02.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}听起来像是我会做的事。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Sounds like something I would've done.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:04.76,0:41:06.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但事情没完全\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But didn't exactly work out
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.16,0:41:08.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}按你希望的那样发展，对吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}the way you wanted it to, though, did it?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:08.64,0:41:11.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}因为结果你得到的是我。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}'Cause instead you got me.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:15.67,0:41:18.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这下有得玩了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This is gonna be fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:21.91,0:41:23.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}回见。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}See ya.
